{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国握手会in名古屋"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださって\nありがとうございましたっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/09/3337379/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恒例の抽選会での自己紹介。\nまりっか'17をちょっと歌ったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/09/3337379/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんをいじり倒す宣言したら\nみさにツッコまれたよ。うん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんまりっかレーン"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/09/3337379/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんのことは\nしょっちゅういじってる笑\n握手会では2人して異様に\nテンションが高く\nうえいうえいしてました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にたくさんの方が\n握手しに来てくださって、\nめちゃくちゃ嬉しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/09/3337379/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごいびっくりした。\n本当にありがとうございました><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかった♪\nまりっ会安定。\nサユリストのみなさん\nありがとうございました！\nまりっか'17一緒に歌ってくれて\nありがとうございました笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、震災募金のご協力\nありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は生写真の撮影と\n収録がありました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生写真、流行りのかわいい春夏服\nいっぱい着た"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/09/3337379/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段自分が着ないような服着るの\n楽しいのよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/09/3337379/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日撮影、レッスン頑張ってくる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/09/3337379/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではおやすみなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}